</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 191);\">1) 서류접수 및 선발 : 회사에서 진행</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 191); font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold;\">2) 장학금 지급 : 학교에서 학생에게 입금 (9월 경)</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"pointer-events: none; left: -10px; font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt; display: inline-block; position: relative; text-indent: -13px;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\">신청기간 : 5월 1일(목)~6월 13일(금)</span></p><ul style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 40px; font-family: &quot;Harmony Light&quot;; font-size: 13px;\"><li style=\"list-style-type: none; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 11pt;\"></span></p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
